I suspect you must be reading "ci" as a quantifier (with scope over
the quantifier "re") there, otherwise I don't see how you can get
anything other than exactly two things from that.

   re lo cimei be lo broda cu brode

Given the referents of "lo cimei be lo broda": eaxctly two of them do brode=
.

That's all.

What do we know about the referents of "lo cimei be lo broda", we know
that they are three and that they are among the referents of "lo
broda".

What do we know about the referents of "lo broda"? That they broda.

